{# Shared header for every markdown page: what this page is, and where its HTML,
   feed and JSON live. `machine` comes from machine.links(); nav_prefix is the
   same relative prefix the HTML page uses. #}
{% macro header(title, machine, nav_prefix) %}
# {{ title }}

- **TrackLLM** — machine-readable twin of [{{ machine.html }}]({{ SITE_URL }}/{{ machine.html }}). Every page on the site has a `.md` sibling at the same path; links below point at those.
{% if machine.feed %}
- **Atom feed** of this page's detected changes: [{{ machine.feed }}]({{ nav_prefix }}{{ machine.feed }})
{% endif %}
{% if machine.json %}
- **JSON** this page is rendered from: {% for j in machine.json %}[{{ j }}]({{ nav_prefix }}{{ j }}){{ " · " if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
- **Raw data** (every collected response): {{ DATA_REPO_URL }} · Built {{ built_at }}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro crumb(parts) %}
{% for label, href in parts %}{% if href %}[{{ label }}]({{ href }}){% else %}{{ label }}{% endif %}{{ " / " if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}

{% endmacro %}

{% macro table(headers, rows) %}
| {{ headers | join(" | ") }} |
|{% for _ in headers %} --- |{% endfor %}

{% for row in rows %}
|{% for c in row %} {{ c | cell }} |{% endfor %}

{% endfor %}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro methods(ms) %}{% for m in ms %}`{{ m | upper }}`{{ " " if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}{% endmacro %}
{% macro model_link(nav_prefix, slug, text) %}{% if slug %}[{{ text }}]({{ nav_prefix }}models/{{ slug }}.md){% else %}{{ text }}{% endif %}{% endmacro %}
{% macro provider_link(nav_prefix, slug, text) %}{% if slug %}[{{ text }}]({{ nav_prefix }}providers/{{ slug }}.md){% else %}{{ text }}{% endif %}{% endmacro %}
{% macro org_link(nav_prefix, org) %}[{{ org }}]({{ nav_prefix }}orgs/{{ org | slug }}.md){% endmacro %}

{% macro footer(nav_prefix) %}

---
Data collected via the OpenRouter API. [Home]({{ nav_prefix }}index.md) · [Changes]({{ nav_prefix }}changes.md) · [Methodology]({{ nav_prefix }}methodology.md) · [About]({{ nav_prefix }}about.md) · [GitHub](https://github.com/timothee-chauvin/trackllm_website)
{% endmacro %}
